sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant API as Express API
    participant DB as MongoDB

    User->>UI: Fill incident form and click Submit
    UI->>API: POST /api/incidents
    API->>API: Validate request data1
    API->>DB: Save incident
    DB-->>API: Incident stored
    API-->>UI: 201 Created plus JSON response
    UI-->>User: Updated incident list shown
